BT /F1 10 Tf 56.00 360.89 Td (Displacement is the change in position from the initial point to the final point. It is a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.00 346.89 Td (vector quantity, so it has both magnitude and direction. Displacement can be positive,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.00 332.89 Td (negative, or zero depending on the chosen coordinate direction.) Tj ET
